  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/garden/0",
    "raw": "^#76fe68;Lush ^reset;foothills mark this landing location. Both flora and fauna are abundant here. A beam site of immeasurable safety.",
    "value": "^#76fe68;葱郁的^reset;山麓标志着此着陆点。此地动植物极为丰富。一处安全系数无可估量的着落场。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/garden/1",
    "raw": "The beam site is located in a tranquil area of great bio-diversity. There are resources here that you could use. A ^#76fe68;lush ^reset;and pleasant land.",
    "value": "着陆点位于一片生物多样性丰富且宁静的区域。此处存在可供利用的资源。一片^#76fe68;葱郁^reset;宜人的土地。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/garden/2",
    "raw": "Readings indicate the landing site is not unfavourable - the area is safe, and lavish with both flora and fauna. A ^#76fe68;lush ^reset;and hospitable place.",
    "value": "扫描读数表明该着陆点并非不利 - 此区域安全，且动植物资源丰富。一片^#76fe68;葱郁^reset;而适宜驻留的土地。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/forest/0",
    "raw": "Densely colonized by trees and other flora, this ^#15ce02;forest ^reset;landing site is a hospitable location that supports a diversity of life - potentially including your own.",
    "value": "此处被树木及其他植物群落密集占据，这处^#15ce02;森林^reset;着陆点是一个适宜的环境，支持着多样的生命形式 - 或许，其中也包括你。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/forest/1",
    "raw": "Leafy trees abound in this ^#15ce02;forest ^reset;location. The area is hospitable to life, my database indicates that you may encounter woodland creatures.",
    "value": "此处^#15ce02;森林^reset;地带遍布阔叶林木。该区域适宜生命栖息，据我数据库显示，你或许会遇见林地生物。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/forest/2",
    "raw": "Your beam site for this planet is located in a ^#15ce02;forest^reset;. Readings indicate that this wooded area is relatively tranquil.",
    "value": "你在此星球的传送点位于一片^#15ce02;森林^reset;中。扫描读数显示，该林区氛围相对宁静。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/desert/0",
    "raw": "There is limited flora here on this ^#e6c801;desert^reset;, but the location does support life. ^red;Hot days, cool nights^reset;.",
    "value": "此片^#e6c801;沙漠^reset;植被有限，但该地确实孕育着生命。^red;日间炎热，夜间凉爽^reset;。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/desert/1",
    "raw": "A ^#e6c801;desert^reset; area populated by cacti, as well as various animal life. A relatively safe landing site, so long as you avoid the sandstorms. ^red;Quite warm^reset;.",
    "value": "一片^#e6c801;沙漠^reset;区域，栖息着仙人掌及多种动物。一处^red;相当温暖^reset;且相对安全的着陆点，前提是避开沙尘暴。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/desert/2",
    "raw": "Sand. Readings indicate sand. Also some cacti... but predominantly sand. This ^#e6c801;desert^reset; is ^red;uncomfortably warm^reset; but rich in resources.",
    "value": "沙。扫描显示是沙。还有一些仙人掌...但主要还是沙。这片^#e6c801;沙漠^reset;^red;温暖得令人不适^reset;，但资源丰富。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/snow/0",
    "raw": "This chilly landing site is laden with ^#69f1fd;snow^reset;. Sundry trees grow here and various animals also thrive in the cold conditions. An excellent place to make snowballs.",
    "value": "此寒冷着陆点覆满^#69f1fd;积雪^reset;。各种树木在此生长，多种动物亦于严寒中繁盛。一个制作雪球的绝佳场所。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/snow/1",
    "raw": "The landing location is cold, but not perilously so. ^#69f1fd;Snow^reset; covers the area and blizzards are a possibility. A hat and gloves may be advisable.",
    "value": "着陆点寒冷，但尚不致命。^#69f1fd;积雪^reset;覆盖该区域，且可能出现暴风雪。建议佩戴帽子与手套。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/snow/2",
    "raw": "This location is relatively chill, and ^#69f1fd;snow^reset; lies thickly on the ground. My sensors indicate that there are critters scampering through the soft blanket of white.",
    "value": "此处相对寒冷，^#69f1fd;积雪^reset;厚覆地面。传感器显示有小动物正窜行于柔软的白色雪毯之中。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/savannah/0",
    "raw": "The landing site is situated in an area of ^#ffe21d;dry grassland ^reset;that is hot and prone to dust storms. It is neither especially pleasant, nor especially dangerous.",
    "value": "着陆点位于一片炎热且易发沙尘暴的^#ffe21d;干旱草地^reset;。此地既不特别舒适，也不特别危险。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/savannah/1",
    "raw": "This area of ^#ffe21d;dry grassland ^reset;is sparsely populated by trees. It is not excessively inhospitable - readings indicate that there is a hare bouncing around.",
    "value": "这片^#ffe21d;干旱草地^reset;树木稀疏。它并非极度荒芜 - 扫描读数显示有野兔正在四处跳跃。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/savannah/2",
    "raw": "The landing location is located in an area of ^#ffe21d;dry grassland^reset;. Trees and shrubs grow sparsely in the heat. A dusty place of wide, flat vistas.",
    "value": "着陆点位于一片^#ffe21d;干旱草地^reset;。树木与灌木因炎热而生长稀疏。这是一处尘土飞扬、视野广阔而平坦的地方。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/ocean/0",
    "raw": "A planet of deep ^#008aff;oceans^reset; and small islands. My readings indicate that aquatic life is abundant and that the islets of the surface are extremely picturesque.",
    "value": "一颗遍布深邃^#008aff;海洋^reset;与小型岛屿的星球。扫描读数表明，水生生物十分丰富，且星球表面的小岛风光美丽如画。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/ocean/1",
    "raw": "An ^#008aff;ocean^reset; covered planet spotted with islands and teeming with life. My readings indicate that there is a great deal of activity in the depths of the waters.",
    "value": "一颗^#008aff;海洋^reset;覆盖、岛屿点缀且生机盎然的星球。我的扫描读数表明，水域深处存在大量的活动迹象。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/ocean/2",
    "raw": "Floating desert islands pepper the surface of this ^#008aff;ocean^reset; planet. An environment of tropical ambiance and aesthetic.",
    "value": "漂浮的沙岛如胡椒粉般点缀于这颗^#008aff;海洋^reset;星球的表面。一处兼具热带氛围与美学享受的环境。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/toxic/0",
    "raw": "This planet is ^#06ff00;toxic^reset; - the air is putrefied and the oceans are poisonous. ^red;Radiation levels are moderate^reset; and dense clouds of ^06ff00;poison^reset; cover the surface.",
    "value": "这颗星球有^#06ff00;毒^reset; - 空气已腐坏，海洋含剧毒。^red;辐射水平为中等^reset;，且地表覆盖着稠密的^#06ff00;毒云^reset;。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/toxic/1",
    "raw": "This ^red;moderately radioactive^reset; planet is a poisonous wilderness inhabited by irradiated lifeforms. Its luminescent surface is ^#06ff00;toxic^reset; with dense ^red;poisonous air^reset;. ",
    "value": "这颗^red;中等放射性^reset;行星是一片有毒的荒野，栖息着受辐射的生命形式。其发光的地表呈现^#06ff00;剧毒^reset;特性，并弥漫着稠密的^red;有毒空气^reset;。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/toxic/2",
    "raw": "This is a ^#06ff00;toxic^reset; planet replete with ^red;radiation and poisonous air^reset;. The noxious oceans are ^red;lethally poisonous^reset;. ",
    "value": "这是一颗充满^#06ff00;毒性^reset;的星球，遍布^red;辐射与有毒空气^reset;。其有害的海洋^red;具有致命毒性^reset;。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/jungle/0",
    "raw": "The landing site is in a dense, hot ^#12a003;jungle^reset;. A menagerie of astounding creatures live amongst the lush flora. It is a shame about the ^red;moderately high radiation^reset;.",
    "value": "登陆点位于一片茂密、炎热的^#12a003;丛林^reset;中。各种令人惊叹的生物栖息在繁茂的植物群中。遗憾的是，这里有^red;中高程度的辐射^reset;。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/jungle/1",
    "raw": "A ^#12a003;jungle^reset; landing site densely inhabited by flora and fauna of many kinds. The area is rich with resources but quite hot and ^red;moderately radioactive^reset;.",
    "value": "一处^#12a003;丛林^reset;登陆点，密集栖息着多种动植物。该区域资源丰富，但相当炎热且^red;具有中等放射性^reset;。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/jungle/2",
    "raw": "^red;Moderate, unsafe levels of radiation^reset; render this ^#12a003;jungle^reset; location an extremely hostile environment and local fauna is similarly unwelcoming.",
    "value": "^red;中度、不安全的辐射水平^reset;使得这片^#12a003;丛林^reset;点成为一处极度恶劣的环境，当地的动物群也同样不友好。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/alien/0",
    "raw": "This is a somewhat risky landing site - ^red;radiation levels are moderately high^reset;. However, the ^#7800ff;mutated^reset; terrain could be described as darkly whimsical.",
    "value": "这是一处略有风险的登陆点 - ^red;辐射水平中高^reset;。然而，其^#7800ff;突变后的^reset;地形或可描述为一种诡异的奇观。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/alien/1",
    "raw": "A landing site characterised by odd flora, aggressive fauna and ^red;moderately high levels of radiation^reset;. The area's inhabitants are severely ^#7800ff;mutated^reset;.",
